{"id":"c6c452d9588f09ff","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-tableau-decision.md","title":"Independent Tableau Decision Procedure for GL","display":"thm-gl-tableau-decision — Independent Tableau Decision Procedure for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-tableau-decision","aliases":["89-thm-gl-tableau-decision"],"display":"thm-gl-tableau-decision — Independent Tableau Decision Procedure for GL","depends_on":["[[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]]","[[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]]","[[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","[[89-df-effective-computation]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-tableau-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-tableau-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-tableau-decision — Independent Tableau Decision Procedure for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb687bda8415ad17\" href=\"?note=fb687bda8415ad17\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination\">89-lem-gl-tableau-termination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b271bf5e7002b205\" href=\"?note=b271bf5e7002b205\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness\">89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84ff5236d2f50db8\" href=\"?note=84ff5236d2f50db8\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cd488da32dcaca7b\" href=\"?note=cd488da32dcaca7b\" title=\"89-df-gl-tree-frame\">89-df-gl-tree-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A^k\">\\(T_A^k\\)</span> 是已定义的确定真值树序列，终止性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fb687bda8415ad17\" href=\"?note=fb687bda8415ad17\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination\">89-lem-gl-tableau-termination</a> 保证。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLTree}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLTree}\\)</span> 使用原接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 采用本书固定有效有限树编码及程序定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_A,T_A,d_{\\mathrm{tab}}\">\\(N_A,T_A,d_{\\mathrm{tab}}\\)</span> 在下面定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nN_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{k\\in\\omega\\mid\\mathsf{SatTab}(T_A^k)\\},\\quad T_A\\coloneqq T_A^{N_A},\\\\\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathsf{Cl}(T_A),\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(T_A),\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(d_{\\mathrm{tab}}),\\qquad\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;d_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)=0\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists W\\ \\exists R\\subseteq W^2\\ \\exists V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\ [\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land(W,R,V),r\\not\\models A].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nN_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{k\\in\\omega\\mid\\mathsf{SatTab}(T_A^k)\\},\\quad T_A\\coloneqq T_A^{N_A},\\\\\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathsf{Cl}(T_A),\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(T_A),\\end{cases}\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(d_{\\mathrm{tab}}),\\qquad\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;d_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)=0\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists W\\ \\exists R\\subseteq W^2\\ \\exists V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\ [\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land(W,R,V),r\\not\\models A].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.138–146。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>使用已在模态规则中写明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}\\)</span> 的重写关系和确定策略，终止与每步有效性使程序为总程序。若返回闭树，闭树可靠性推出 GL 定理；若返回开放树，反模型提取引理给出有限 GL 框架反例，GL 可靠性排除其为定理。</p>\n<p>这条证明重建原书第 10 章的独立完全性/判定链。依赖中没有第 5 章完全性或第 9 章 Solovay 定理；两者可以作为应用，但不承担此程序的正确性。返回 0 时也可返回明确的有限反模型证书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination","status":"resolved","id":"fb687bda8415ad17","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"b271bf5e7002b205","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","status":"resolved","id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination","status":"resolved","id":"fb687bda8415ad17","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$T_A^k$ 是已定义的确定真值树序列，终止性由 [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] 保证。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"T_A^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLTree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"N_A,T_A,d_{\\mathrm{tab}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}decision}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nN_A&\\coloneqq\\min\\{k\\in\\omega\\mid\\mathsf{SatTab}(T_A^k)\\},\\quad T_A\\coloneqq T_A^{N_A},\\\\\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&\\mathsf{Cl}(T_A),\\\\0,&\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(T_A),\\end{cases}\\\\\n&\\operatorname{Comp}(d_{\\mathrm{tab}}),\\qquad\nd_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&d_{\\mathrm{tab}}(A)=0\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists W\\ \\exists R\\subseteq W^2\\ \\exists V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\ [\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land(W,R,V),r\\not\\models A].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}","display":false}],"bytes":2244,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee8821b1cefc81b2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 5 章，印刷页 83–84；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限反模型先取反例根生成的子模型，再展开为从根出发的有限严格路径。投影到路径最后世界，对赋值取逆像；forth/back 的盒归纳保持各公式真值。树展开的世界数可能增加，不把原来的 $2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}$ 界强加于树模型。第 10 章的独立真值树证明现已展开于 [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]；[[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] 同时给出上述盒子公式数约束的关系高度界。两条证明分别使用路径展开与窗口提取，不把真值树记录当作 Kripke 框架。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["fb687bda8415ad17","b271bf5e7002b205","84ff5236d2f50db8","0157f8bea9275cf1","0006800fa1c85177","cd488da32dcaca7b","3997bfb78544d69c"]}